OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,FWeightlifter Emily Campbell has
OL,8,Fdescribed her consecutive Commonwealth
OL,9,FGames gold as a "really special" win.
OL,11,FThe Nottingham athlete told ITV News
OL,12,Fher priority was the medal but
OL,13,Fbreaking a record as well has put the
OL,14,Faccomplishment "right up there".
OL,16,FThe 32-year-old won a Games-record
OL,17,Ftotal of 278kg on Thursday 30 July in
OL,18,FGlasgow.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"Records were on the cards, but
OL,8,Fpriority was to get the shiny thing
OL,9,Faround your neck, make sure its the
OL,10,Fcolour gold and then after that we go
OL,11,Ffor the records. My body was in ball
OL,12,Fand we managed to get them above
OL,13,Fhead," says Emily.
OL,15,FIn 2022, she secured a gold medal at
OL,16,Fthe Birmingham Commonwealth Games.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"Birmingham was special in every way -
OL,8,Ffrom flag bearing to the perfect
OL,9,Fperformance. I was at the peak of my
OL,10,Fcareer at that time. To come four
OL,11,Fyears later, a bit more of a seasoned
OL,12,Fathlete, little older, been through
OL,13,Ftrials and tribulations but then to
OL,14,Fpull off the performance I did - it's
OL,15,Fright up there."
OL,17,FDespite her previous win, she wasn't
OL,18,Fcomplacent this year.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"You never take these moments for
OL,8,Fgranted. Just because you won gold
OL,9,Ffour years ago doesn't mean you'll win
OL,10,Fone again.
OL,12,F"So, to be able to do that is such an
OL,13,Fhonour, especially in front of a home
OL,14,Fcrowd. It's really special."
OL,16,FSurrounded by support
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"My team are very good at shielding
OL,8,Fme. I know every decision they make
OL,9,Fthey make it for a reason. I know I
OL,10,Fjust need to go out there and
OL,11,Fexecute," says Emily.
OL,13,FAnd she describes her family and
OL,14,Ffriends as the "Barmy Army" who come
OL,15,Fclad with "their t-shirts on".
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"They're always massively supportive
OL,8,Fand honestly I wouldn't get through it
OL,9,Fwithout them, especially my parents
OL,10,Fand my sister. My sister actually
OL,11,Flives in LA but she always flies back,
OL,12,Fshe always makes sure she's there and
OL,13,Fshe was the organiser of the
OL,14,Fcelebrations last night!
OL,16,F"To do something you love in front of
OL,17,Fthe people you love - can't really ask
OL,18,Ffor more than that."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,FAnd she thanks the crowds cheering her
OL,8,Fon, motivating her to perform on the
OL,9,Fbig stage.
OL,11,F"I can't quite explain the noise, it
OL,12,Fwas insane (with) the acoustics in
OL,13,Fthere. It's a massive arena but it
OL,14,Ffelt very close as well. Without that
OL,15,Fcrowd I don't think I would've
OL,16,Fperformed the way I did."
OL,18,F'Pure pride'
OL,26,@tD@LpmtD@Qpn
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"I'm a very proud Nottingham girl,
OL,8,Fvery proud to represent the city and
OL,9,Falways very proud to represent Team
OL,10,FEngland," says Emily.
OL,12,F"You go out with the lion on your
OL,13,Fchest and pure pride, it's really nice.
OL,15,F"We want to thank the National Lottery
OL,16,Ffor helping us out. We had an
OL,17,Fincredible prep camp in Loughborough,
OL,18,Fwhich I feel like bonded us a bit more.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"And as the weightlifting team right
OL,8,Fnow, it's our most successful medal
OL,9,Fhaul. So we're very, very happy and
OL,10,Fthat's why the celebrations were high
OL,11,Flast night."
OL,13,FAs she recovers from a night of
OL,14,Frejoicing, she's looking forward to
OL,15,Fsome downtime.
OL,17,F"I'll be catching up with sleep,
OL,18,Fheading back home and then chill time
OL,19,Fwith the family," says Emily.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785584876
OL,3,C'Right up there': Weightlifter
OL,4,Creflects on record-breaking
OL,5,CCommonwealth gold
OL,7,F"And - eventually - make my way back
OL,8,Finto the gym."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
